How'd it go last night, huh?
(chuckles)

1907
01:20:19,300 --> 01:20:21,133
Where did he go?

1908
01:20:21,167 --> 01:20:22,300
Beyond the river?

1909
01:20:22,333 --> 01:20:23,800
Uh, you can call me
Dad if you want,

1910
01:20:23,833 --> 01:20:27,067
Earl or Dad, whatever feels
comfortable. (chuckles)

1911
01:20:32,233 --> 01:20:34,267
Thong, the fish are ready.

1912
01:20:35,233 --> 01:20:37,500
Anybody see my extra spear?

1913
01:20:38,667 --> 01:20:40,933
- Jailbreak, tonight, six. -
Our son is gone.

1914
01:20:40,967 --> 01:20:41,700
No.

1915
01:20:41,733 --> 01:20:43,033
I must bring him back.

1916
