Everyone will want death now.

1920
01:20:52,433 --> 01:20:54,133
Put aside some food.

1921
01:20:54,167 --> 01:20:56,533
I'll leave after a time.

1922
01:20:58,533 --> 01:21:00,833
Suddenly it's a John Ford film.

1923
01:21:00,867 --> 01:21:03,133
It's like She Wore a
Yellow Loincloth.

1924
01:21:03,167 --> 01:21:05,767
(chuckles) What is this,
Grand Central Station?

1925
01:21:09,667 --> 01:21:11,233
Neat, curios.

1926
01:21:13,167 --> 01:21:16,533
Punch out for me, did you
get the cash card?

1927
01:21:16,567 --> 01:21:19,100
This is a job for Mighty Jack.

1928
01:21:22,033 --> 01:21:24,033
It is Baloo.

1929
01:21:28,100 --> 01:21:29,500
Go to the girl.

1930
01:21:29,533 --> 01:21:30,433
Go to the what?

1931
01:21:30,467 --> 01:21:31,600
Go to the dogs?

1932
01:21:31,633 --> 01:21:33,333
Go to the moon?

1933
01:21:33,367 --> 01:21:35,567
What a dope.

1934
01:21:37,167 --> 01:21:39,333
This guy needs a hobby.

1935
01:21:41,867 --> 01:21:43,700
Don't sit here so.

1936
01:21:43,733 --> 01:21:45,500
The clan will wonder.

1937
01:21:46,867 --> 01:21:47,633
Stop!

1938
01:21:47,667 --> 01:21:48,900
In the name of Grog.

1939
01:21:48,933 --> 01:21:49,667
Girl.

1940
01:21:49,700 --> 01:21:51,200
You know it's true.

1941
01:21:51,233 --> 01:21:52,900
Why do you stay in
the one place,

1942
01:21:52,933 --> 01:21:54,200
