1943
01:21:54,233 --> 01:21:56,200
Is there a word against it?

1944
01:21:56,233 --> 01:21:57,700
I only ask.

1945
01:21:57,733 --> 01:22:01,933
Just trying to make some
conversation is all.

1946
01:22:01,967 --> 01:22:05,633
(fun futuristic music)

1947
01:22:10,000 --> 01:22:11,967
♪ Ooga chaka ooga ooga

1948
01:22:12,000 --> 01:22:14,500
♪ Ooga chaka ooga ooga

1949
01:22:14,533 --> 01:22:16,533
I can't stop this feeling.

1950
01:22:17,200 --> 01:22:18,333
What?

1951
01:22:18,367 --> 01:22:20,467
Is he in Florida now?
Busch Gardens?

1952
01:22:20,500 --> 01:22:24,533
(birds chirping)

1953
01:22:28,600 --> 01:22:30,933
- (mooing noise) -
Busch Gardens.

1954
01:22:30,967 --> 01:22:33,567
(car noises)

1955
01:22:36,700 --> 01:22:42,533
(humming)

1956
