Huh, wha?

1963
01:23:11,300 --> 01:23:12,300
Go on.

1964
01:23:12,333 --> 01:23:13,533
Go on!

1965
01:23:13,567 --> 01:23:14,700
Go on.

1966
01:23:14,733 --> 01:23:16,367
Across the river,
into the forest!

1967
01:23:16,400 --> 01:23:19,500
How can the word be served if we
too break the law?

1968
01:23:19,533 --> 01:23:20,500
Ed Nelson?

1969
01:23:20,533 --> 01:23:21,633
Yeah.

1970
01:23:23,833 --> 01:23:26,533
We seek to aid it,
and to keep it.

1971
01:23:26,567 --> 01:23:29,000
There can be no wrong in that.

1972
01:23:29,033 --> 01:23:31,333
Who'll care for the women
and the young?

1973
01:23:31,367 --> 01:23:33,167
I'll do it, I will.

1974
01:23:33,200 --> 01:23:34,900
The evil will come to all of us!

1975
01:23:34,933 --> 01:23:38,067
Unless we find the young symbol
maker and his father

1976
