- and kill them! - Hey, say it,
don't spray it!

1977
01:23:40,033 --> 01:23:43,000
Do you serve towels
with your showers?

1978
01:23:44,533 --> 01:23:45,700
Come on!

1979
01:23:47,533 --> 01:23:49,533
He who moves for the word...

1980
01:23:49,567 --> 01:23:50,733
Shut up!

1981
01:23:50,767 --> 01:23:52,867
...will come to no harm
in that place.

1982
01:23:52,900 --> 01:23:54,233
(burps)

1983
