Watch that spear!

1993
01:24:36,000 --> 01:24:37,767
Keep your hands off my trunk!

1994
01:24:40,800 --> 01:24:42,733
But for Richard Kimball,
hunted man,

1995
01:24:42,767 --> 01:24:44,533
