1996
01:24:46,700 --> 01:24:49,967
If I were a Flintstone,
yabba dabba dabba.

1997
01:24:50,000 --> 01:24:54,100
(humming)

1998
01:24:55,200 --> 01:24:56,533
It's about time, it's
about space,

1999
01:24:56,567 --> 01:24:58,400
it's about time I
slapped your face.

2000
01:25:03,800 --> 01:25:06,767
(humming)

2001
01:25:06,800 --> 01:25:09,033
Yuck, watch out for that.

2002
01:25:12,233 --> 01:25:15,933
There should be a toga party
around here somewhere.

2003
01:25:17,800 --> 01:25:22,600
His little toothpick legs won't
hold him up much longer!

2004
01:25:22,633 --> 01:25:26,100
(humming)

2005
01:25:26,133 --> 01:25:29,333
(barking)

2006
01:25:30,633 --> 01:25:32,200
If a tree fell in the forest,

2007
01:25:32,233 --> 01:25:34,600
