over budget?

2008
01:25:35,900 --> 01:25:37,933
I wonder if he's got a seven
day waiting period

2009
01:25:37,967 --> 01:25:39,267
on that bow and arrow.

2010
01:25:39,300 --> 01:25:40,600
Eh, I don't know.

2011
01:25:41,367 --> 01:25:41,933
Huh?

2012
01:25:41,967 --> 01:25:42,933
What?

2013
01:25:47,767 --> 01:25:49,667
Hey, it's Louie Nye!

2014
01:25:49,700 --> 01:25:51,367
Hi ho, Steverino!

2015
01:25:52,200 --> 01:25:56,967
(humming)

2016
01:25:57,000 --> 01:26:00,633
(barking)

2017
01:26:01,733 --> 01:26:03,500
(laughs) Great.

2018
01:26:03,533 --> 01:26:05,500
It's an anteater pinata.

2019
