You came to take me back.

2024
01:26:20,133 --> 01:26:20,933
Aye.

2025
01:26:20,967 --> 01:26:22,567
At first.

2026
01:26:22,600 --> 01:26:24,933
Now I stay to help in
your purpose.

2027
01:26:24,967 --> 01:26:25,533
Neat.

2028
01:26:25,567 --> 01:26:26,567
Hold back.

2029
01:26:26,600 --> 01:26:27,667
No.

2030
01:26:27,700 --> 01:26:30,100
This is the god they fear.

2031
01:26:30,133 --> 01:26:32,133
Mr. Snuffleupagus?

2032
01:26:32,167 --> 01:26:34,600
The law will be gone and a
new way open to us.

2033
01:26:36,600 --> 01:26:39,000
Back up, wait, what's
gonna happen here?

2034
01:26:39,033 --> 01:26:40,367
It motions as the man from
the burning place.

2035
01:26:40,400 --> 01:26:41,900
Anarchy in the BC.

2036
01:26:41,933 --> 01:26:44,567
It rises to attack,
cast your arrow!

2037
01:26:46,033 --> 01:26:50,200
(humming)

2038
01:26:50,233 --> 01:26:53,167
(barking)

2039
01:26:53,633 --> 01:26:54,567
Kill them now.

2040
