Look!

2041
01:26:55,700 --> 01:26:56,700
It is wild.

2042
01:26:56,733 --> 01:26:58,200
Oh, forget it.

2043
01:26:58,233 --> 01:26:59,567
Kill him in the sight of the
god that gives death

2044
01:26:59,600 --> 01:27:01,700
with its touch and it will
know our desire.

2045
01:27:01,733 --> 01:27:04,200
So, you're saying it's evil?

2046
