He doesn't do that to everybody.

2050
01:27:17,000 --> 01:27:18,100
Just push him down.

2051
01:27:18,133 --> 01:27:19,933
Down, boy.

2052
01:27:19,967 --> 01:27:22,300
See what happens when you don't
