2053
01:27:22,333 --> 01:27:23,033
Yep.

2054
01:27:28,800 --> 01:27:30,200
Skipper, I love you!

2055
01:27:30,233 --> 01:27:32,133
Oh that one, he hates the vet.

2056
01:27:35,500 --> 01:27:36,733
