Oh, don't you start.

2075
01:28:30,733 --> 01:28:32,000
The law is dead.

2076
01:28:32,033 --> 01:28:34,200
The god that gives death
with its touch

2077
01:28:34,233 --> 01:28:35,533
is dead as well.

2078
01:28:35,567 --> 01:28:37,667
He's dead, word's dead, law’s
dead, I'm outta here!

2079
01:28:37,700 --> 01:28:39,367
Goodnight everybody!

2080
01:28:40,100 --> 01:28:41,467
He's looked better.

2081
01:28:41,500 --> 01:28:42,733
Beach Dickerson.

2082
01:28:42,767 --> 01:28:44,700
A man.

2083
01:28:44,733 --> 01:28:46,333
Another kind of man.

2084
